WEBVTT

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:03.670
After infiltrating Kokuboro,

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.500
Yoshimori continues to search
for Kaguro to avenge Shishio.

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.300
Tokine runs in search
of Yoshimori.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.690
And then...

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.130
Tokine!

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:15.870
Yoshimori!

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:22.780
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:24.650
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:29.860
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.760
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.200
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.600
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:43.140
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.470
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:52.140
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.640
Sha la la la la...

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:03.060
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.030
(Secret romance)

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:10.230
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:11.990
(A strange distance)

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.840
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:19.910
Yeah

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:23.380
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:26.980
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:32.320
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:52.640
What are you doing here?!

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:56.100
Same goes for you!
Coming to Kokuboro alone!

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:58.550
You're doing the same thing!

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.640
I came to get you!

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.710
I told you not to come!

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.510
You want to avenge
Gen-kun, right?

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.760
You weren't his only friend.

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:16.290
Besides, you think you can win
against Kaguro by yourself?

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.700
I know his speed and power are
at a completely different level...

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:25.040
But I have to do it!

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:26.270
Ketsu!

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.540
Hey?! What are you doing?!

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:32.540
I don't want you near me.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:37.940
If I have to depend on you,
I'll never be able to beat him!

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.440
Sorry!

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:40.510
Yoshimori!

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.530
Outside might be better...

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.340
Hey. You're way too energetic.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:09.180
Come out, Kaguro!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:10.610
Metsu!

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.700
You're Kaguro, right?

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:33.840
Oh, right... This is the first time
you see me in this form...

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:38.140
Maybe I should have worn
the human skin as a handicap.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.270
Ketsu!

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:44.310
Don't be hasty.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.720
Let's chat a little first.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.220
I don't need to talk to you!

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.390
Oh? But...

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.090
You're fighting to
avenge your friend, right?

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.590
What was his name?
Shishio-kun?

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.330
Why don't you talk
a little about him?

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.260
Ketsu!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:04.600
Kaguro!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.030
Hmph.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:10.140
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:15.610
Is this an attack? It's no use.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:19.020
No matter how much
you read into my movements,

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:24.860
the speed of your Kekkai formation
isn't quick enough to catch me.

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:28.220
He disappeared!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.830
There are other problems.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:35.330
You can't surround your enemy
if you don't know their position.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:36.960
In other words,

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.940
your technique depends
heavily on your perception.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.710
I wonder if you know
what that means?

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.100
Calm down!

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:49.120
If he isn't wearing
the human skin,

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.280
I can tell his general location
from his aura...

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.340
Down below!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:07.860
Sekkai!

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:14.440
His techniques have
powered up recently,

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:15.930
so they're harder to release.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:17.900
Wait...

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.940
maybe I can use that technique
to escape from the Kekkai...

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.880
How to enter Kokuboro?

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:27.920
Yes. The Other World is different
from this world, right?

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:30.310
How are you
supposed to get there?

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.550
You must create a passage.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:39.090
Try taking out this sachet
without destroying the Kekkai.

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:42.630
What? Is this a trick question?

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.930
You can't create a passage with
trick questions or by wits alone.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.160
Listen.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.370
First, you must read the range
and wavelengths of the technique.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:54.770
Wow.

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:58.380
This is a good opportunity.
Would you like to practice it?

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:04.520
I couldn't do it back then.
But I have to do it now!

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:10.260
First, read the range
and wavelengths of the technique...

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.570
Huh... Uh...
Did I do it?

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.230
All right!

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:24.300
Wait, this isn't the time
to celebrate!

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:25.840
I have to stop him!

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:30.490
You know,
your techniques seem logical...

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.050
but they're actually
quite arbitrary.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.380
Oh, was that too
difficult to understand?

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:40.460
The Kekkai techniques you use
are heavily dependent on

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.520
the character and state of mind of
the caster, not just their ability.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:46.900
For example, your Kekkai
gets stronger if you put

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:48.660
stronger emotions into it, right?

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.700
Are you angry and frustrated
because your friend was murdered?

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:59.610
Then show me how strong
that emotion feels!

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:07.840
Here he comes!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.320
See?

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:16.490
You couldn't see the first strike
so you couldn't block it.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:19.100
But you could on the second strike.

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:22.930
That shows you can strengthen your
Kekkai just by thinking about it.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:27.170
Though it's still no match
for my sword.

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.240
I'll tell you this, though...

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.110
Your spells aren't effective
in close combat.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.550
If the enemy is too close,
you can't cast the spell.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:37.520
When attacked,
you're too busy blocking.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.280
Now let's take it up a notch.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:47.130
Make sure you don't
let me get too close!

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:57.590
Something's going on over there...
It's Kaguro and that Kekkaishi kid.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:03.000
Ketsu!

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:04.400
Yoshimo-!

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:06.940
What are you doing?!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.950
I just saved your life.
Don't look at me like that.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.180
What are you talking about?!

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:14.050
We have to stay out of this.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:19.220
Look. If you get involved,
he won't be able to fight anymore.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:29.490
Look at them getting all excited.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:33.570
That kid was desperate
to fight Kaguro.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:37.970
But it seems Kaguro is
in a playful mood...

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.140
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:46.480
That's odd... This is too easy.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.120
But...

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.190
I can't stop anymore!

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:05.430
This is...

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.510
What was that about
not letting you get too close?

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:13.110
You know, I hate being lectured.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.060
This Kekkai covers my whole body.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:35.140
It can block attacks like armor
and deflect anything it touches.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:36.830
So it works both offensively
and defensively.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.770
Your sword is a lot more
fragile than I thought.

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:43.870
That's...

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.870
What?! Do you know about that?

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.250
Y-Yeah... I saw it once.

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:52.750
I was waiting for that!

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:56.210
Shut up! Don't think you have
the upper hand forever!

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.250
One touch and it's over for you!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:02.760
I name this technique...
The Total Destruction Kekkai!

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.190
Oh, you poor thing...

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:09.330
You really are terrible
at naming things.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.300
I don't need your sympathy!

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:21.340
But now I know for sure.
Your technique is still incomplete.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:28.080
I saw a complete version
of that long ago.

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:31.260
He was probably a Kekkaishi, too.

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:36.100
It looked and felt much darker.

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:38.490
Anyone who stepped
into his boundary

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:40.900
would vanish without a trace...

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:46.640
It was a pure mass of power where
rage and hatred swirled together...

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:51.540
The Kekkaishi himself was serene,
and he had a horrifying cold stare,

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.640
as if he wasn't even human.

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:57.390
If I remember correctly,
I think he called that technique...

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:59.150
the "Zekkai".

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:01.680
Zekkai?

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.680
You're right. It is like armor.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.100
But you can't absorb
all the shock.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:44.860
And it doesn't cover you evenly.

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:48.130
The areas you can't focus on
are way too fragile.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:52.200
If I hit those spots
a little harder, you get cut.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:55.070
It's far from the Zekkai.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.040
Your emotions and power
are far from enough.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:05.020
You thought you knew
Shishio-kun, but did you really?

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:09.380
You probably didn't know
he was really troubled.

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:14.820
I knew it right away
just by looking at him.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.360
Because he and I
were a bit similar.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.230
His energy just increased.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.370
I guess I should keep jabbing
at his bonds with others.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:31.770
...Him.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.610
Don't lecture me about him!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:41.140
You'll understand if I explain.
You and I are similar, too.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.490
You must've felt

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.150
the difference between yourself
and the world around you.

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:48.720
A difference?

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:55.060
A feeling like you don't belong,
as if the world is rejecting you.

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.000
That's exactly what was
troubling that kid.

00:12:58.610 --> 00:12:59.600
I don't care!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.070
Ketsu! Ketsu!
Ketsu!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.240
The kid's power is
gradually increasing.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:10.580
Come on. Listen to me.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:14.020
Don't talk like you know him!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:15.950
I do know him.

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:18.160
I told you, didn't I? We're alike...

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.730
I was an outsider when
I was human, much like him.

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:24.390
Human?!

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:31.590
Though I didn't have
any special powers like you guys.

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:36.140
That's why I told
your troubled friend

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:39.040
how he could set himself free.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:43.110
I told him to cut his ties with
the world that rejects him

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.080
and free himself.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:47.250
Just like I did...

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:05.700
Stop! Very well done, Sakai.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:09.940
With this match, Sakai,
you shall be appointed as

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:11.240
the assistant master instructor
of this dojo.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.610
Yes, sir! Thank you very much!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:18.380
Why?! Why can't I win?

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:34.160
I want to become stronger...
Stronger than everybody...

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.000
How do I do it?

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:41.470
I don't know... Should I train more?
Do I not have enough resolve?

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.480
Eat up, Kuroda-kun.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.240
The roasted rice cakes
from this shop are great.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:57.990
Hey, Sakai-san. What can I do
to become stronger?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.130
You're strong already.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.900
You were training on your own
before joining the dojo,

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.730
and in just two years, you're
strong enough to almost beat me.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.120
I'm very grateful to you.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:11.560
I had no money, I couldn't
go to any dojos but you...

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:15.970
What are you talking about?
I owe my life to you.

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:20.840
When I was attacked by thugs,
you came to my aid.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.370
Because of that,
I survived.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:28.210
You seemed much stronger
than me back then.

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:33.780
But I've never won
against you even once.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:38.600
If the weapons we use
were not wooden swords,

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:40.190
but real ones,
you would probably be stronger.

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:41.590
Huh?!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:46.700
Your biggest strength may be
that you don't hesitate.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:48.940
In the esoteric book,
there is a saying,

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:51.070
"When one meets a god,
one must slay it."

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:54.310
"When one meets Buddha,
one must slay it."

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:59.390
If you have that sort of mentality,
anyone can become stronger.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:14.930
I am Makabe Ittosai! You dare
disrespect me while knowing this?

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:19.460
I am Kuroda Genichiro.
I wish for a duel with real swords.

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:23.000
Real swords, you say?
In this era of peace...

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:30.710
Very well. I cannot let
a killer wander the streets.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.440
I shall accept your challenge.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:44.650
I have failed...

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:58.710
You have defeated me,
Saito Inoshiro...

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:14.180
I love this feeling.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:18.030
- You're under arrest!
- You're under arrest!

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.060
Kuroda is to be expelled!
Do you understand?!

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:30.970
How can this happen?!
Did he misunderstand my advice?!

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.540
Was he that much of a fool?!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.580
When I told him about
the gods and Buddha, I meant...

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.060
When one meets a god,
one must slay.

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:53.330
When one meets Buddha,
one must slay.

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:57.600
I will become stronger than anyone!

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:09.580
Now that we're warmed up,
we should get going.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.680
Yep.

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:13.650
Oh?

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.750
It's a demon!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.370
So you've descended onto
the path of evil while still alive.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.580
You're a human and yet you can
cleave through my Kekkai...

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:42.780
You are not human anymore.
You are a demon.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.210
It is my duty as a Kekkaishi
to destroy demons.

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:52.620
Your soul shall pass on
by touching the Zekkai!

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:12.210
You may think you have escaped,
but only darkness awaits you.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:37.600
Ayakashi! Can I beat that monk
if I come over to your side?!

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:39.070
Yeah, yeah.

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:47.600
Kuroda-kun!

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:50.410
I've heard about you
from a traveling monk!

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:54.860
He said when you ran from him,
you ran towards the light...

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.520
to the fire and
not toward the dark.

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:58.310
However little it may be,

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:00.290
he said you still have
the heart of a human.

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:03.860
Then you can still be saved!
Open your eyes!

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.260
Come back to this side!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:08.120
Why do you hesitate?
We'll welcome you.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.160
No one will deny you here.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:15.170
Just take that one step.
It'll put you out of your misery.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.910
I will sever everything!
Shred everything!

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.420
Until nothing is left!

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:25.910
You fool...

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:28.050
Then this is the least
I can do for you.

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:32.920
It is my duty as your friend
to end your suffering.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:47.500
Kuroda-kun?!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:53.940
I have failed...

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:00.990
In a duel with real swords,
the one who hesitates loses.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.420
You can't show any mercy.

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:07.990
Hey, Ayakashi!
Take me to your world!

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.300
Our brother!
One of our brothers has been born!

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:19.370
He has severed all ties
by killing his friend!

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:21.470
He is now completely alone!

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:33.880
I did it! I've finally
made it over to this side!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:41.760
If Shishio-kun went
past his boundaries,

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.820
he could've ended
his suffering like me.

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:47.400
But he couldn't
throw anything away.

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:52.100
You know, you have the potential
to be free like me, too.

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:55.340
Aren't you feeling out of place?

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:59.200
What are you talking about?
You want me to be like you?

00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:01.840
Never!

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:05.980
Then prepare yourself!

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:09.190
I'll increase my power like you.

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:11.760
It'll be different from earlier.

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:15.450
I'll put powerful emotions
into this sword...

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:20.760
The desire to sever and shred
until nothing is left.

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:51.420
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:59.330
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:22:59.710 --> 00:23:01.870
"What nerve"

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:05.240
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:08.980
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:09.020 --> 00:23:15.350
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:20.390
I hate studying,
I like P.E. okay

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:22.330
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:27.600
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:31.130
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:35.230
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:49.720 --> 00:24:00.070
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
